# Git LFS is intentionally disabled for this branch.
#
# The repository's Git LFS budget is exhausted, so any path routed through LFS
# is stored on the remote as an unreadable pointer file rather than content.
# Every path below is therefore kept as an ordinary Git blob so that clones and
# external verification see real bytes.
#
# Re-enable LFS only with a verified quota, and renormalize the whole tree
# before pushing again.
#
# *.zip    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.tar.gz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.dll    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.zip.part* filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.map    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.bin    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.csv    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text